  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Set air fryer to 200°C. Cut sweet potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• In a medium bowl, combine sweet potato, sweet soy seasoning and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Place veggies into the air fryer basket and cook for 10 minutes. Shake the basket, then cook until tender, a further 5-10 minutes. TIP: No air fryer? Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Place sweet potato on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with sweet soy seasoning and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the sweet potato chunks between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66970d9b4b756a3c98190631-e3b9f03f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice cucumber into rounds.\n• In a medium bowl, combine the vinegar and a good pinch of sugar and salt.\n• Add cucumber to pickling liquid. Add enough water to just cover cucumber. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66970d9b4b756a3c98190631-fce106a6.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice lemon into wedges.\n• Trim and roughly chop pea pods.\n• In a large bowl, combine sweet chilli sauce, a good squeeze of lemon juice and a drizzle of olive oil. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66970d9b4b756a3c98190631-1d69d48b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks.\n• When sweet potato has 5 minutes remaining, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook tofu, tossing until browned, 3-4 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66970d9b4b756a3c98190631-4a8e5662.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "To bowl with dressing, add deluxe salad mix and pea pods, tossing to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66970d9b4b756a3c98190631-9cf15b24.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain pickled cucumber.\n• Divide roasted soy sweet potato, Japanese tofu, cucumber and deluxe salad between bowls.\n• Drizzle over sesame dressing. Sprinkle over mixed sesame seeds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66970d9b4b756a3c98190631-d715fbd2.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
